40
00:01:54,680 --> 00:01:57,500
Getting hit by a meteor and dying
at a traffic-light intersection

41
00:01:57,520 --> 00:01:59,380
- is even more likely to happen.
- Wow...

42
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:00,640
Whoa...

43
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:04,200
You really think
I wanna get with you that badly?

44
00:02:11,710 --> 00:02:12,800
What about you, though?

45
00:02:13,810 --> 00:02:15,020
Anything you wanna tell us?

46
