47
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:21,310
Well, that day when we left first.

48
00:02:22,010 --> 00:02:25,620
There was a battle of the suitors, I hear?

49
00:02:30,030 --> 00:02:31,200
What battle?

50
00:02:31,530 --> 00:02:32,440
That's crazy!

51
00:02:32,620 --> 00:02:33,690
No battle.

52
00:02:35,700 --> 00:02:37,440
Your voice got awfully high, huh?

53
00:02:37,460 --> 00:02:38,700
I bet there was.

54
00:02:40,700 --> 00:02:41,520
Spill it.

55
00:02:47,890 --> 00:02:48,579
Hey.

56
00:03:04,940 --> 00:03:08,920
♫I've been wondering♫

57
00:03:08,940 --> 00:03:13,040
♫What's it like to fall in love? (Do you know the answer?)♫

58
00:03:13,060 --> 00:03:15,040
