59
00:03:15,060 --> 00:03:17,180
♫Asking Gemini hasn't helped me at all♫

60
00:03:17,200 --> 00:03:21,380
♫Only you can help me find out how to love♫

61
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:23,500
♫That's why I've been bothering you♫

62
00:03:23,520 --> 00:03:27,660
♫I'll be there no matter what you do, you do, you do♫

63
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:30,320
♫Please, teach me♫

64
00:03:30,340 --> 00:03:34,620
♫What is love, love, love supposed to be?♫

65
00:03:34,640 --> 00:03:39,030
♫Can someone teach, teach me
how it should be?♫

66
00:03:39,050 --> 00:03:43,780
♫I saw people in love,
so I wanted some love for me♫

67
00:03:43,800 --> 00:03:47,650
♫Wanna love, love, so please help me♫

68
00:03:47,670 --> 00:03:49,010
♫Can you teach me?♫

69
00:04:08,370 --> 00:04:09,570
I miss you, Gear.

70
00:04:11,180 --> 00:04:12,470
Can we get back together?

71
00:04:32,390 --> 00:04:33,390
Gear.

72
00:04:38,380 --> 00:04:39,380
Kanthi?

73
00:04:45,570 --> 00:04:47,080
I've been looking for you.

74
00:04:49,370 --> 00:04:50,400
- Let's go.
- Go...

75
00:04:50,860 --> 00:04:51,800
Go where?

76
00:04:54,300 --> 00:04:55,520
To our dinner, of course.

77
00:04:57,770 --> 00:04:58,880
Our dinner?

78
00:04:59,310 --> 00:05:00,170
Yeah.

79
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:01,770
Let's go.

80
00:05:01,980 --> 00:05:02,750
Gear.

81
00:05:05,490 --> 00:05:06,680
I'm happy

82
00:05:06,990 --> 00:05:08,560
you're still using the bag I bought for you.

83
00:05:26,960 --> 00:05:28,360
You're fucking happy, huh?

84
00:05:29,170 --> 00:05:30,870
Get it into your thick skull.

85
00:05:30,890 --> 00:05:32,409
Don't touch what's mine.

86
00:05:36,580 --> 00:05:37,860
Gear and I used to be boyfriends.

87
00:05:37,880 --> 00:05:39,100
You're the one who came after!

88
00:05:40,409 --> 00:05:41,540
Kanthi! Kim!

89
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:43,210
That's enough.

90
00:05:45,190 --> 00:05:46,590
Don't fight over me,

91
00:05:47,090 --> 00:05:47,990
please.

92
00:05:48,200 --> 00:05:49,040
I'm begging you.

93
00:05:52,390 --> 00:05:53,280
Gear.

94
00:05:54,380 --> 00:05:55,120
Hey!

95
00:05:55,409 --> 00:05:55,980
Yes?

96
00:05:56,230 --> 00:05:57,440
I'm sorry?

97
00:05:57,700 --> 00:05:58,600
Let's go home.

98
00:06:16,910 --> 00:06:17,620
Wait.

99
00:06:17,640 --> 00:06:18,290
Yes?

100
00:06:19,200 --> 00:06:20,500
Show me your bag.

101
00:06:24,780 --> 00:06:26,280
Don't make me repeat myself.

102
00:06:41,600 --> 00:06:42,400
Hey!

103
00:06:42,760 --> 00:06:43,700
Kanthi!

104
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:45,300
What are you doing?

105
00:06:45,940 --> 00:06:47,470
Why did you throw away my bag?

106
00:06:47,990 --> 00:06:49,270
I'll buy you a new one.

107
00:06:49,590 --> 00:06:50,380
Get in the car.

108
00:06:51,490 --> 00:06:52,080
Huh?

109
00:06:52,990 --> 00:06:54,440
Do you have trouble hearing?

110
00:06:55,580 --> 00:06:56,480
Oh,

111
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:58,980
do you still use the bag he gave you

112
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:00,200
because you still like him?

113
00:07:08,580 --> 00:07:09,440
Why are you smiling?

114
00:07:10,390 --> 00:07:11,760
Are you admitting

115
00:07:12,010 --> 00:07:13,800
that you still like that guy?

116
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:17,000
Have you lost your memory?

117
00:07:17,510 --> 00:07:19,520
Take some brain supplements.

118
00:07:20,190 --> 00:07:21,390
Did you forget

119
00:07:21,410 --> 00:07:23,000
what he's done to you?

120
00:07:25,690 --> 00:07:27,200
You're taking this too far.

121
00:07:27,890 --> 00:07:29,880
I really have no feelings
for him anymore.

122
00:07:37,390 --> 00:07:38,110
Are you sure?

123
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:40,390
Yes.

124
00:07:42,310 --> 00:07:43,790
But if you really don't like him anymore,

125
00:07:44,190 --> 00:07:46,010
how come you still use
the stuff he bought you?

126
00:07:48,190 --> 00:07:49,190
Well...

127
00:07:50,200 --> 00:07:51,990
it's a pretty durable bag.

128
00:07:52,700 --> 00:07:54,690
Plus, it's very spacious.

129
00:07:58,200 --> 00:07:59,500
Okay, okay, okay.

130
00:07:59,980 --> 00:08:01,800
If you don't like it, though,

131
00:08:02,390 --> 00:08:04,490
I won't use it anymore.

132
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:14,690
[Chanmit Karaoke]

133
00:08:14,710 --> 00:08:15,600
There it is.

134
00:08:17,490 --> 00:08:18,920
I think he definitely likes you.

135
00:08:19,910 --> 00:08:21,440
Would he get this jealous otherwise?

136
00:08:23,180 --> 00:08:24,240
I think so, too.

137
00:08:25,390 --> 00:08:26,040
Huh?

138
00:08:27,390 --> 00:08:28,670
That's weird coming from you.

139
00:08:29,270 --> 00:08:30,920
Don't you usually try to argue against it?

140
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:33,600
Well, he's making it pretty obvious.

141
00:08:33,900 --> 00:08:35,059
What is there to argue about?

142
00:08:38,409 --> 00:08:39,280
But...

143
00:08:39,610 --> 00:08:41,559
let me give you a warning, Gear.

144
00:08:42,200 --> 00:08:44,110
That Mr. Kanthi

145
00:08:44,600 --> 00:08:46,200
is a player.

146
00:08:46,220 --> 00:08:47,390
Is that what you're trying to say?

147
00:08:48,600 --> 00:08:49,520
That's not it.

148
00:08:49,900 --> 00:08:50,590
Oh.

149
00:08:51,790 --> 00:08:53,100
I just wanted to tell you...

150
00:08:53,490 --> 00:08:54,920
not to rush into making a decision

151
00:08:55,700 --> 00:08:56,700
because...

152
00:08:57,290 --> 00:08:59,440
if you're truly not ready for love,

153
00:09:02,310 --> 00:09:03,580
it's only gonna hurt you.

154
00:09:15,100 --> 00:09:16,240
What's the matter with him?

155
00:09:19,500 --> 00:09:20,560
No clue.

156
00:09:27,100 --> 00:09:28,100
Gear.

157
00:09:28,380 --> 00:09:29,120
Hm?

158
00:09:29,310 --> 00:09:31,990
With so many guests coming,

159
00:09:32,290 --> 00:09:33,880
can the three of us handle it?

160
00:09:35,790 --> 00:09:37,760
Between welcoming the guests,

161
00:09:38,890 --> 00:09:39,890
serving drinks,

162
00:09:40,140 --> 00:09:41,200
and preparing the food,

163
00:09:42,290 --> 00:09:43,800
how are the three of us gonna manage?

164
00:09:45,990 --> 00:09:47,200
Don't worry, guys.

165
00:09:47,900 --> 00:09:50,160
Kanthi said he'd find someone to help.

166
00:09:56,590 --> 00:09:58,390
Come on, let's get back to work.

167
00:09:59,790 --> 00:10:00,600
Who on earth?

168
00:10:01,490 --> 00:10:03,190
Isn't this one crooked?

169
00:10:03,900 --> 00:10:04,560
- Yeah. Pond.
- Look.

170
00:10:05,300 --> 00:10:06,080
Kanthi,

171
00:10:06,890 --> 00:10:08,700
do you want the usual
for your birthday this year?

172
00:10:08,880 --> 00:10:11,300
I'll find you someone hot tonight, man.

173
00:10:13,190 --> 00:10:14,900
Can it wait until after the wedding?

174
00:10:15,610 --> 00:10:17,640
I have to help make sure
everything's in order tonight

175
00:10:17,660 --> 00:10:19,260
before the actual wedding tomorrow.

176
00:10:19,890 --> 00:10:21,240
Your dad's wedding?

177
00:10:21,500 --> 00:10:22,760
Like hell it is, bastard.

178
00:10:22,980 --> 00:10:23,720
What?

179
00:10:24,160 --> 00:10:26,190
When you asked the club for waiters

180
00:10:26,210 --> 00:10:27,780
to help with a wedding.
Whose wedding is it?

181
00:10:28,380 --> 00:10:30,890
It's Gear's grandparents' wedding.

182
00:10:30,910 --> 00:10:32,600
They're getting married tomorrow.

183
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:36,960
Old people getting married?

184
00:10:37,090 --> 00:10:38,320
Yeah, why?

185
00:10:40,140 --> 00:10:40,900
Nothing.

186
00:10:41,100 --> 00:10:41,840
It's just...

187
00:10:42,610 --> 00:10:43,780
interesting.

188
00:10:50,020 --> 00:10:50,560
Guys.

189
00:10:51,190 --> 00:10:51,890
Hm?

190
00:10:55,280 --> 00:10:56,360
I have something to tell you.

191
00:10:57,540 --> 00:10:58,320
What is it?

192
00:11:11,010 --> 00:11:11,810
This is Shin,

193
00:11:13,010 --> 00:11:13,920
my boyfriend.

194
00:11:15,810 --> 00:11:16,600
And this...

195
00:11:17,500 --> 00:11:18,560
is Kanthi,

196
00:11:19,410 --> 00:11:20,810
a luxury car dealer.

197
00:11:21,810 --> 00:11:24,160
If you're looking for a car,
you can let him know.

198
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:26,760
He'll give you a special deal.

199
00:11:29,010 --> 00:11:30,160
And that's Porsche,

200
00:11:31,300 --> 00:11:32,500
also a shareholder of Rose Club.

201
00:11:35,510 --> 00:11:36,510
Hello.

202
00:11:36,700 --> 00:11:38,440
Nice to meet you all.

203
00:11:39,910 --> 00:11:41,200
Yes.

204
00:11:42,710 --> 00:11:43,680
Big Boss,

205
00:11:44,210 --> 00:11:46,200
since when did you secretly
get yourself a boyfriend?

206
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:48,480
Hold up.

207
00:11:48,900 --> 00:11:50,960
Is he Boss Chai's son?

208
00:11:56,810 --> 00:11:57,810
It's a long story.

209
00:11:57,910 --> 00:11:58,610
Mm.

210
00:11:58,730 --> 00:11:59,730
Let's just say...

211
00:12:00,400 --> 00:12:01,490
I brought him here to introduce him.

212
00:12:02,820 --> 00:12:04,320
I want you guys to get to know each other.

213
00:12:07,260 --> 00:12:08,260
Alright, alright.

214
00:12:08,700 --> 00:12:11,720
Anyway, nice to meet you, Mr. Shin.

215
00:12:12,610 --> 00:12:14,400
Also, congrats.

216
00:12:15,900 --> 00:12:17,000
Because Big Boss here

217
00:12:17,190 --> 00:12:19,100
is definitely serious about you;

218
00:12:19,130 --> 00:12:21,640
otherwise, he wouldn't have
introduced you to us.

219
00:12:23,710 --> 00:12:24,520
Hang on a sec.

220
00:12:24,890 --> 00:12:28,190
I mean... I don't want
to rain on your parade,

221
00:12:29,010 --> 00:12:30,040
but...

222
00:12:30,690 --> 00:12:31,760
is Boss Chai okay with this?

223
00:12:34,910 --> 00:12:36,000
That's the thing.

224
00:12:37,900 --> 00:12:39,320
That's why I need you guys' help.

225
00:12:48,280 --> 00:12:50,580
[Red Wine Club]

226
00:12:53,510 --> 00:12:54,510
Why the hell are you here?

227
00:12:57,800 --> 00:12:59,360
I'm here to negotiate a truce.

228
00:13:01,200 --> 00:13:02,320
Truce?

229
00:13:03,590 --> 00:13:04,440
Yes.

230
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:07,380
I think it's a good idea, Dad.

231
00:13:07,900 --> 00:13:09,920
That way, we can do business
with peace of mind.

232
00:13:10,440 --> 00:13:11,280
Quiet.

233
00:13:12,610 --> 00:13:14,600
I came here to negotiate today

234
00:13:15,310 --> 00:13:16,690
because I understand

235
00:13:17,890 --> 00:13:20,160
your son will soon take over from you.

236
00:13:22,110 --> 00:13:24,240
You wouldn't want your son

237
00:13:24,920 --> 00:13:26,600
to have a difficult road ahead, would you?

238
00:13:33,110 --> 00:13:34,340
Are you threatening me?

239
00:13:35,390 --> 00:13:37,100
Easy there, sir.

240
00:13:37,400 --> 00:13:38,560
Don't get riled up just yet.

241
00:13:45,590 --> 00:13:46,590
This is Mr. Kanthi,

242
00:13:48,320 --> 00:13:50,000
Mr. Kantapon's son,

243
00:13:51,160 --> 00:13:52,520
the godfather of the luxury car industry.

244
00:13:57,600 --> 00:14:00,140
Is your father friends with the minister?

245
00:14:05,800 --> 00:14:06,800
That's correct.

246
00:14:07,400 --> 00:14:09,660
My father is a close friend of Uncle Wisarut.

247
00:14:15,740 --> 00:14:17,880
Mr. Kanthi has become
a major shareholder in Rose Club.

248
00:14:20,200 --> 00:14:21,990
He doesn't want to
see the same old problems

249
00:14:23,200 --> 00:14:25,280
you caused at Rose Club,

250
00:14:26,440 --> 00:14:28,240
so he asked me to bring him here
to talk with you.

251
00:14:29,320 --> 00:14:31,500
Instead of remaining business rivals,

252
00:14:33,600 --> 00:14:35,290
wouldn't it be better if we became allies?

253
00:14:39,660 --> 00:14:40,800
If I say yes,

254
00:14:42,410 --> 00:14:43,840
what's the deal?

255
00:14:45,310 --> 00:14:46,640
Peace, of course.

256
00:14:48,400 --> 00:14:50,000
You must know very well

257
00:14:51,410 --> 00:14:53,200
that if you go up against
someone at that level,

258
00:14:54,380 --> 00:14:56,440
even the Dragon of this district like you

259
00:14:57,910 --> 00:14:59,090
wouldn't survive.

260
00:15:04,100 --> 00:15:05,710
Think carefully, sir.

261
00:15:07,000 --> 00:15:08,640
I think that our clubs

262
00:15:09,400 --> 00:15:11,600
should become allies

263
00:15:12,190 --> 00:15:14,240
to make things easier for your son

264
00:15:15,410 --> 00:15:17,220
moving forward, don't you agree?

265
00:15:19,900 --> 00:15:21,680
Interesting deal.

266
00:15:24,500 --> 00:15:25,910
But I'm not accepting it.

267
00:15:29,600 --> 00:15:30,390
Dad,

268
00:15:30,800 --> 00:15:32,040
have you thought it through?

269
00:15:33,010 --> 00:15:35,300
I don't care whose son you are

270
00:15:36,490 --> 00:15:39,200
because your father isn't
the only one with powerful connections.

271
00:15:40,290 --> 00:15:42,560
I wouldn't have
lasted this long otherwise.

272
00:15:43,110 --> 00:15:44,010
Sir,

273
00:15:45,380 --> 00:15:48,220
I'm proposing a way for us to work together.

274
00:15:52,490 --> 00:15:53,920
When the fuck did I tell you

275
00:15:54,180 --> 00:15:55,720
that I wanted to coexist with you?

276
00:15:56,980 --> 00:16:00,340
You opening a club on my turf
is already too much of an insult!

277
00:16:02,080 --> 00:16:04,040
If you want to live in peace,

278
00:16:05,610 --> 00:16:07,100
you have only one option.

279
00:16:08,600 --> 00:16:10,600
Move your club off my turf.

280
00:16:25,090 --> 00:16:26,090
It's alright.

281
00:16:28,850 --> 00:16:30,600
If you can't come to your senses...

282
00:16:32,780 --> 00:16:34,400
At your age,

283
00:16:35,100 --> 00:16:36,900
you need plenty of time to think.

284
00:16:39,500 --> 00:16:41,000
I'll come back to negotiate again.

285
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:44,000
Come on, let's go!

286
00:16:57,030 --> 00:16:58,900
Why didn't you accept their deal?

287
00:17:00,820 --> 00:17:03,290
I already made myself clear.
Didn't you hear me?

288
00:17:05,800 --> 00:17:07,119
I've seen a lot of small clubs

289
00:17:07,270 --> 00:17:09,040
around here.

290
00:17:09,220 --> 00:17:10,839
You don't seem to have a problem with them.

291
00:17:13,400 --> 00:17:15,260
It's about dignity.

292
00:17:16,319 --> 00:17:17,780
You'll understand in time.

293
00:17:26,300 --> 00:17:27,609
Dignity, Dad?

294
00:17:29,300 --> 00:17:31,000
If we had any dignity,

295
00:17:31,500 --> 00:17:34,780
you wouldn't have sent your own son off
to marry a woman he doesn't love

296
00:17:34,810 --> 00:17:36,680
to strengthen your family.

297
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:39,920
Shin.

298
00:17:41,060 --> 00:17:41,920
Shin!

299
00:18:04,780 --> 00:18:05,920
My future father-in-law

300
00:18:06,600 --> 00:18:07,640
is so fucking stubborn.

301
00:18:07,920 --> 00:18:10,080
Even after I used
Kanthi's dad's connections,

302
00:18:10,500 --> 00:18:11,560
