310
00:18:33,080 --> 00:18:35,720
We once brought our guys
to threaten him right at his club.

311
00:18:36,100 --> 00:18:37,110
And this time,

312
00:18:37,390 --> 00:18:38,540
we went to see him

313
00:18:38,690 --> 00:18:39,840
to negotiate a truce,

314
00:18:40,260 --> 00:18:41,760
but it still came across as a threat.

315
00:18:42,790 --> 00:18:44,440
Now picture it the other way around.

316
00:18:44,680 --> 00:18:46,200
If you were him,

317
00:18:46,790 --> 00:18:48,360
