379
00:22:26,400 --> 00:22:30,560
♫Happy birthday to you♫

380
00:22:30,920 --> 00:22:35,310
♫Happy birthday to you♫

381
00:22:35,420 --> 00:22:39,720
♫Happy birthday to you♫

382
00:22:39,760 --> 00:22:45,000
♫Happy birthday, happy birthday♫

